,{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは今日は短いけど\nここらへんでばいばい\n純奈との握手会だから\n皆さんぜひ遊びにきてね〜\n純奈との仲良しペアだから\n絶対わちゃわちゃ握手になると思う◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全握の時、いつもハルジオン見てて\n私もまた踊りたいなって思っちゃう\nハルジオンのサビのぴょんぴょん\n跳ねるとこが大好き\n踊ってたら自然と笑顔になっちゃう曲"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それではまたあとで会おうね◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/yuuri.saito/img/2016/05/04/3976949/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、そうだ！にゃんちゃんなのって\nどうい意味なの？ってメンバーに聞かれたり\nファンの方にも言われるけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全然意味はないんです..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ただ、ただ言いたいだけなの♡♡♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も生駒に聞かれちゃった( ˙˘˙ )笑い"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たんたんたん ゆったんたん( •ㅈ• )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"_"}],"source":"archive"},"sba-nogi-59084":{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寒いですね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも太陽が元気で良いですね╭│ᵕ̈│╯"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"千葉県出身"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高校2年生"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"16歳の"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"松尾美佑です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まつおみゆです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"typ